3040:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_tim.c ****   * @note   Switching from Center Aligned counter mode to Edge counter mode (or reverse)
3041:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_tim.c ****   *         requires a timer reset to avoid unexpected direction
3042:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_tim.c ****   *         due to DIR bit readonly in center aligned mode.
3043:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_tim.c ****   *         Ex: call @ref HAL_TIM_Encoder_DeInit() before HAL_TIM_Encoder_Init()
