3047:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_tim.c ****   * @note   When the timer instance is initialized in Encoder mode, timer
3048:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_tim.c ****   *         channels 1 and channel 2 are reserved and cannot be used for other
3049:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_tim.c ****   *         purpose.
3050:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_tim.c ****   * @param  htim TIM Encoder Interface handle
