8028:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_tim.c ****   *          This parameter can be one of the following values:
8029:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_tim.c ****   *            @arg TIM_ETRPRESCALER_DIV1: ETRP Prescaler OFF.
8030:../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_tim.c ****   *            @arg TIM_ETRPRESCALER_DIV2: ETRP frequency divided by 2.
